      <pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 02:07:15 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;PostGIS 3.7 is out, serving a reminder that everything doesn't need AI branding.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The most interesting part of the release is its continued focus on topology and showing maintaining clean spatial relationships remains a priority for the project.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;For anyone responsible for authoritative boundaries, utility networks, transportation data, or cadastral systems, that's a big deal.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://mastodon.social/tags/PostGIS" class="mention hashtag" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank"&gt;#&lt;span&gt;PostGIS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://mastodon.social/tags/Topology" class="mention hashtag" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank"&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Topology&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://mastodon.social/tags/PostgreSQL" class="mention hashtag" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank"&gt;#&lt;span&gt;PostgreSQL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://mastodon.social/tags/SpatialSQL" class="mention hashtag" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank"&gt;#&lt;span&gt;SpatialSQL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://mastodon.social/tags/OpenSourceGIS" class="mention hashtag" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank"&gt;#&lt;span&gt;OpenSourceGIS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://mastodon.social/tags/DataEngineering" class="mention hashtag" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank"&gt;#&lt;span&gt;DataEngineering&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://davidgsmith.net/thoughts/postgis-37-is-out-and-it-doubles-down-on-topology.html?utm_source=mastodon&amp;amp;utm_medium=social_share&amp;amp;utm_campaign=thoughts" rel="nofollow noopener" translate="no" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;span class="invisible"&gt;https://&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ellipsis"&gt;davidgsmith.net/thoughts/postg&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="invisible"&gt;is-37-is-out-and-it-doubles-down-on-topology.html?utm_source=mastodon&amp;amp;utm_medium=social_share&amp;amp;utm_campai